  prices.                                                                                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                       
  This project deterministically extracts every single faucet photo, part code (SKU), and price directly from the PDF text and geometry layers, feeds them into a database, and provides a web app     
  where someone can filter, search, compare, and build a room-by-room quotation sheet.                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                       
